WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.352
Klaus Schwab said it on camera, at Harvard, on the record: 'We penetrate the cabinets.'

00:00:05.352 --> 00:00:15.931
This report documents forty-seven confirmed Canadian Young Global Leader alumni, over seven Trudeau visits to Davos as Prime Minister, and Chrystia Freeland sitting on the WEF Board of Trustees.

00:00:15.931 --> 00:00:24.624
Our grandfathers did not storm Juno Beach so that eighty years later, unelected foreign billionaires could dictate Canadian policy at Swiss ski resorts.

00:00:24.624 --> 00:00:30.624
The policy alignment between WEF white papers and Canadian legislation is documented and sourced.
